chaochun-subtitle
=================

This repository is a derivative fork/extension of:

    oil-subtitle
    https://github.com/oil-oil/oil-subtitle

The upstream project is authored and maintained by oil-oil and contributors.
chaochun-subtitle keeps the original ASR → review → preview → FFmpeg burn
pipeline and adds a letterbox bilingual burned-in layout.

Upstream GitHub currently does not declare a license field. This fork still
attributes the original work, preserves copyright notices present in the
imported sources, and does not claim authorship of the upstream code.

If you use, copy, or redistribute this skill, please retain this notice and
the upstream project link.
